<title>ESTONIA: HOIUPANK TO MAKE LITHUANIA EXPANSION CLEAR.</title>
<headline>HOIUPANK TO MAKE LITHUANIA EXPANSION CLEAR.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank is expected to release details of its proposed expansion to Lithuania before the end of June, Hoiupank said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are planning on releasing some information before the end of the month,&quot; Kristi Liiva, from the bank's public relations department, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We want to say what will happen but not before the end of the month,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>Hoiupank said in March this year that it was considering a move to the Lithuanian market and was going to start negotations with three Lithuanian banks.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
